PN,30501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FA Norwegian teenager has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of travelling to the UK to
OL,8,Fcarry out a killing on behalf of an
OL,9,Finternational crime gang backed by
OL,10,FIran.
OL,12,FJohannes Kongsnes Natland, 19, agreed
OL,13,Fto shoot an unknown target for 25,000
OL,14,Feuros (#21,500) in March last year.
OL,16,FTwo days after arriving in the UK from
OL,17,Fhis home in Stavanger, armed police
OL,18,Fswooped to arrest him at a hotel in
OL,19,FHuddersfield, West Yorkshire, and
OL,20,Fseized two guns and 12 live bullets.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FNatland admitted possession of the
OL,7,Ffirearms and ammunition but claimed he
OL,8,Fwould have shot himself in the foot to
OL,9,Fget out of the "pickle" he was in with
OL,10,Fthe proscribed Swedish Foxtrot gang.
OL,12,FHowever, jurors heard he had lied
OL,13,Frepeatedly following his arrest and
OL,14,Feven tried to persuade his girlfriend
OL,15,Fnot to give evidence in phone calls
OL,16,Ffrom prison.
OL,18,FAn Old Bailey jury deliberated for 17
OL,19,Fhours and six minutes to find him
OL,20,Fguilty of conspiracy to murder
OL,21,Ffollowing a retrial.
OL,26,@qD@POUqD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FNatland blinked but gave no other
OL,7,Freaction in the dock as the jury
OL,8,Fdelivered its verdict. A date for his
OL,9,Fsentencing will be fixed in the autumn.
OL,11,FNatland's recruiter, a 17-year-old
OL,12,Fyouth known as "Generalen", was
OL,13,Fconvicted in Norway of attempting to
OL,14,F"contribute to murder" in May last
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,26,@tD@POUtD@ZO]vD@AOUvD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FGeneralen was working for the
OL,7,Fproscribed Swedish Foxtrot gang, which
OL,8,Fis backed by the Iranian regime and
OL,9,Fknown for deploying children as young
OL,10,Fas 13 in drug smuggling and violent
OL,11,Fcrimes.
OL,13,FHe brought part-time pizza restaurant
OL,14,Fworker Natland in on the plot after
OL,15,Fanother recruit backed out.
OL,17,FHe was controlled by an English-
OL,18,Fspeaking boss called "Agent 47", in
OL,19,Fapparent reference to the Hitman video
OL,20,Fgame and movie franchise.
OL,26,@zD@VOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FThree more people have been charged by
OL,7,FNorwegian police.
OL,9,FNatland was on his way to the UK when
OL,10,Fhe heard via a group chat that
OL,11,FGeneralen had been arrested for
OL,12,Fconspiracy to murder but carried on
OL,13,Fanyway.
OL,15,FUnder Agent 47's close direction,
OL,16,FNatland took a flight from his home in
OL,17,FStavanger, Norway to Manchester
OL,18,FAirport on a temporary passport on
OL,19,FMarch 17 last year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FHe was stopped by Border Force
OL,7,Fofficials in Manchester, who bailed
OL,8,Fhim to return to the airport to catch
OL,9,Fthe next direct flight home.
OL,11,FInstead, he took a taxi to
OL,12,FHuddersfield where he picked up #2,000
OL,13,Fin cash, two guns and bullets and was
OL,14,Fdirected to a stolen Nissan with false
OL,15,Fplates to be used in the killing.
OL,17,FNatland then settled into his room at
OL,18,Fthe Briar Court Hotel, telling his
OL,19,Fgirlfriend he had got the "bangs in
OL,20,Fthe bag" and taking selfies with the
OL,21,Fguns and cash spread on his bed.
OL,26,@{D@[OU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FOn the eve of the planned shooting,
OL,7,FAgent 47 warned the defendant: "We
OL,8,Fhave much to do tomorrow."
OL,10,FAt 5.15am the next day, armed police
OL,11,Fbanged on Natland's hotel room to
OL,12,Farrest him ` seizing a semi-automatic
OL,13,Fpistol, a revolver, 12 rounds of live
OL,14,Fammunition, gloves, and #2,000 in cash.
OL,16,FAt his trial, one of Natland's friends
OL,17,Frecalled a conversation with him about
OL,18,F"Swedish Foxes" in which the defendant
OL,19,Fhad bragged: "I'm going to get a lot
OL,20,Fof money and somebody is going to die."
OL,26,@oD@`OUpD@ZO]zD@AOUzD@OO]{D@NOU|D@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FNatland had also confided in his
OL,7,Fgirlfriend, saying in a message: "I'm
OL,8,Fgoing on crazy mission."
OL,10,FAccording to her, he said: "Now I can
OL,11,Ffinally kill someone and it's perfect
OL,12,Fas I get money to do it. I can kill
OL,13,Fsomeone and life will be wonderful."
OL,15,FAsked if he had thought it through, he
OL,16,Ftold her: "It will be a bit cool to
OL,17,Fkill someone. If I don't get caught we
OL,18,Fhave to celebrate."
OL,26,@oD@bOUpD@XO]rD@\OUuD@dO]xD@KOUzD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
