PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785338294
OL,3,CNorwegian teenager travelled to the UK
OL,4,Cto carry out a hit for Iran-backed gang
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FGiving evidence, Natland said he
OL,12,Fwanted to look "cool" to his peers but
OL,13,Fit was just "bravado" and inside he
OL,14,Fwas "terrified".
OL,16,FHe told jurors: "I wasn't an
OL,17,Finternational assassin. I thought
OL,18,Fpeople had this impression and
OL,19,Fexpected me to be this guy. I knew I
OL,20,Fwasn't."
OL,26,@tD@POUtD@UO]uD@MOUuD@UO]vD@EOUvD@OO]xD@
OL,26,AQOU|D@HO]
